om/repos/grpc/grpc/deployments","created_at":"2014-12-08T18:58:53Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T23:16:03Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-12T17:45:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/grpc/grpc.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:grpc/grpc.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc","homepage":"https://grpc.io","size":589086,"stargazers_count":44070,"watchers_count":44070,"language":"C++","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":11011,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":1158,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":11011,"open_issues":1158,"watchers":44070,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"### What version of gRPC and what language are you using?\r\n\r\nv1.31.0-pre2 (b54a5b338637f92bfcf4b0bc05e0f57a5fd8fadd)\r\n\r\n### What operating system (Linux, Windows,...) and version?\r\n\r\nLinux, RHEL 7.4\r\n\r\n\r\n### What runtime / compiler are you using (e.g. python version or version of gcc)\r\n\r\nGCC 8\r\n\r\n### What did you do?\r\n\r\nBuild TensorFlow which uses this project in a custom environment (PATH and LD_LIBRARY_PATH set to installed GCC and its libs)\r\n\r\n### What did you expect to see?\r\n\r\nBuild completes\r\n\r\n### What did you see instead?\r\n\r\nBuild fails when running `protoc` through `generate_cc` with errors like `protoc: /lib64/libstdc++.so.6: version `GLIBCXX_3.4.20' not found` because it wrongly tries to use the system libstdc++.so instead if the one from LD_LIBRARY_PATH\r\n\r\n### Anything else we should know about your project / environment?\r\n\r\nThis issue was first noticed in Bazel 3 itself which copied the `generate_cc` from this project: https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/11855 and https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/11852 and then happened in TensorFlow 2.3.0 too which uses this project directly https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/issues/41857","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/23682/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/23682/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":3999321085,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDM5OTkzMjEwODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/events/3999321085","actor":{"login":"Flamefire","id":309017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTAxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/309017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flamefire","html_url":"https://github.com/Flamefire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flamefire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flamefire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flamefire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flamefire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flamefire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flamefire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flamefire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flamefire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flamefire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"47baf1ec39db12cba866a8504fbdcb6f5d6a7d86","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Flamefire/bazel/commits/47baf1ec39db12cba866a8504fbdcb6f5d6a7d86","created_at":"2020-11-16T09:40:14Z","performed_via_github_app